at":null},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-07-25T10:22:13Z","updated_at":"2026-07-27T14:53:59Z","closed_at":"2026-07-27T14:53:38Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121762","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121762","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121762.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121762.patch","merged_at":"2026-07-27T14:53:38Z"},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121729\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nIn this case, the script instance was the last thing holding a reference to its owner. So during `set_script(Variant())` the script instance destructor would try to free the owner. However since `set_script` was not done yet we tried to destruct the instance a second time through that. We now hold a reference while calling `set_script` to prevent that.\r\n\r\nOur test suite can't test this, since it happens during shutdown. I added it to my personal collection of lifecycle related tests instead: https://github.com/HolonProduction/godot-extended-tests/commit/9977f26f75f6bfb7ea9e417742419e28d1b65e33\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121762/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121762/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}